seccomp.json derives from Docker/Moby's default seccomp profile:
https://github.com/moby/profiles/blob/main/seccomp/default.json
Licensed under Apache License 2.0; see MOBY-LICENSE.

The local profile enables the namespace and mount operations required by
Steam's nested sandbox while retaining the default restrictions on other calls.

Moon's installer and license are downloaded during the image build from the
pinned upstream revision recorded in Dockerfile. Component release selection
is performed by that upstream installer.
